#: ../../library/omv.omv.rst:2
msgid ":mod:`omv` --- OpenMV Cam Information"
msgstr ":mod:`omv` --- OpenMV Cam 資訊"

#: ../../library/omv.omv.rst:7
msgid ""
"The :mod:`omv` module exposes runtime information about the OpenMV Cam "
"itself -- the firmware version, the underlying MCU architecture, the board "
"model and a stable board ID -- so that scripts can adapt their behaviour to "
"the hardware they are running on. It also reports whether the OpenMV IDE is "
"currently attached over the debug protocol via :func:`debug_mode`, which is "
"useful for switching between live preview and standalone operation."
msgstr ""
":mod:`omv` 模組公開關於 OpenMV Cam 本身的執行期資訊 -- 韌體版本、底層 MCU 架構、開發板型號以及穩定的開發板 ID -- "
"使指令碼能依其所執行的硬體調整行為。它也會透過 :func:`debug_mode` 回報 OpenMV IDE "
"目前是否透過除錯協定連接，這對於在即時預覽與獨立運作之間切換相當有用。"

